Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:19.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I was standing in the quiet watching shadows softly breathe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:25.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Those unspoken wishes like a mystery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:31.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Every step feels bigger than but a crowd is all to me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:37.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know who is waiting there but I'll let it be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:40.86,Main,,0,0,0,,If I fall, I die before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:44.16,Main,,0,0,0,,If I break, let there be light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:50.27,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a world behind the fear So it can make me feel alive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Seeing a storm start to avoid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:59.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Showing the miracle we made This time we're about to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:02.59,Main,,0,0,0,,No more fending, drifting by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.59,0:01:04.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep moving
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.81,0:01:11.77,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep it when I'm standing still I'm not losing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.77,0:01:14.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You and your song we're writing still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.93,0:01:20.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Knowing the ending I know I don't need to see the proof
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.99,0:01:23.18,Main,,0,0,0,,The sign is lightening up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:28.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Like he's calling me to you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:49.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I remember all the versions
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:52.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Some are lonely, some are ill or still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.51,0:01:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,No more running away Just hearing echoes afar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:02:01.00,Main,,0,0,0,,If the future is a puzzle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:07.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I am brave enough to solve it If the end is just a journey
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:09.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be ready for the call
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.47,0:02:12.78,Main,,0,0,0,,If I fall, I can be far
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.29,0:02:18.83,Main,,0,0,0,,If I break, let there be light There's a world behind the fear
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:22.07,Main,,0,0,0,,So it can make me feel alive
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.07,0:02:24.86,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep moving
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:31.23,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep it when I'm standing still I'm not losing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.23,0:02:37.23,Main,,0,0,0,,You left me somewhere right still Knowing the ending
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.23,0:02:40.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I know I don't need to see it through
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.41,0:02:44.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm silent right now He's calling me to you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:50.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I can feel it pushing on me Up when the sky, he falls on top of me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.93,0:02:56.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't look back, I only take the ugly for a new one now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:10.28,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep moving
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:19.03,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep it wet and I'm standing still I'm not losing you, I'm somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:23.28,Main,,0,0,0,,right still Knowing the ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.57,0:03:31.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I know I don't need to see it through I'm signing this line up, signing this line up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:33.94,Main,,0,0,0,,He's calling me to you